Instructions:


INSTALLATION:

(COMPLETE SCRATCH)
* Go to the Chrome Extensions Store and install the extension 'Tampermonkey'
* Download the main script
* Create a new script in tampermonkey
* Drag the file onto the open area



If it doesn't work in game:
a) You need to give tampermonkey all permissions to your respective browser.
b) If (a) didnt work, you might need to edit it (delete and re-type the same thing) and save.



Still need help? 
↓↓↓↓↓↓↓↓↓↓↓↓↓↓↓↓
https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=8tyjJD65zws




IN GAME:
* Your native Geo-FS autopilot must be on for this to work.
* Press the IAS or "X" button UI to minimise it. 
* Press the sound icon to mute/unmute audio from this extension.
* Enjoy!


VERY IMPORTANT NOTICE:
* Delete your current script in tampermonkey (v1.3) and install the new (v1.3.1) for a big bug fix.
Save it (Cmd + S) or (Ctrl + S).

* Because this script automatically downloads a file, Tampermonkey might pop up a warning on your screen asking
if the script is allowed to connect to files.catbox.moe. You MUST click "Always Allow" for the audio to work.
